            </td>
          </tr>
          <!-- Content Card -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 40px 0;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: #171717; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #27272a;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding: 40px;">
                    
    <h1 style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #fafafa; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600;">
      Welcome to HushBox
    </h1>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #fafafa; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;">
      Hi Sam,
    </p>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;">
      One interface. Every feature. Private.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #fafafa; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;">
      How Billing Works
    </h2>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">
      HushBox is pay-as-you-go. No subscriptions, no recurring charges. Add credits when you need them &mdash; they never expire.
    </p>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 4px 0; color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">
      We charge a transparent 15% fee on AI model usage:
    </p>
    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 0 0 16px 16px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="color: #ec4755; font-size: 14px; padding: 2px 8px 2px 0; vertical-align: top;">&#8226;</td>
        <td style="color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">5% &mdash; HushBox</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="color: #ec4755; font-size: 14px; padding: 2px 8px 2px 0; vertical-align: top;">&#8226;</td>
        <td style="color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">4.5% &mdash; Card processing</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="color: #ec4755; font-size: 14px; padding: 2px 8px 2px 0; vertical-align: top;">&#8226;</td>
        <td style="color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">5.5% &mdash; Provider overhead</td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    <h2 style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #fafafa; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;">
      Adding Credits
    </h2>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">
      Visit the Billing page to add credits with any card. Your credits never expire and are ready to use across all models.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #fafafa; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;">
      For Mobile App Users
    </h2>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">
      Tap &ldquo;Manage Balance Online&rdquo; to add credits through our website. We route you to the web to avoid passing high in-app processing fees on to you &mdash; keeping your costs low.
    </p>
  
                  </td>
